## Key Learning

Infrastructure sizing should be periodically reviewed as virtual environments grow. Although the vCenter Server was functioning correctly, 
its memory allocation no longer matched the size of the managed infrastructure. Following Broadcom's recommended sizing guidelines and performing 
a planned memory upgrade improved overall system health, eliminated recurring alerts, and ensured stable operation without service disruption.
